<BaseLayout title="Buttweld Fittings" active="/technical">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Technical Library" title="Buttweld Fittings" description="Buttweld fittings to ASME B16.9 — elbows, stub-ends, tees, reducers and caps with full dimension tables." />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container layout-2col">
      <div class="prose">
<h3>Buttweld fittings (ASME B16.9)</h3>
<p>Corrosion-resistant, high-temperature fittings in Inconel and stainless grades, simple to install and fabricated to client application requirements.</p>
        <div class="details">
        <div>
          <b>Elbows</b>
          <span><a href="/technical/elbows">90° / 45° dimension & weight tables <svg class="ic" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Stub-ends</b>
          <span><a href="/technical/stub-ends">Lap-joint stub-end tables <svg class="ic" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Tees</b>
