        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Reducers</b>
          <span><a href="/technical/reducers">Concentric / eccentric tables <svg class="ic" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Caps</b>
          <span><a href="/technical/caps">End cap tables <svg class="ic" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Grades</b>
          <span>Inconel 800/825/600/625/601 · 304/304L · 316/316L · 2205 duplex · 2507 super-duplex</span>
